# ── Python bytecode ───────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Logs, lock files, transient sidecar state ─────────────────────
*.log
*.lock
**/.reranker_service.lock
**/.embedding_lock_*

# ── Regenerable runtime caches (rebuilt by the Connector) ─────────
# Committed exceptions: the fitted calibration curves (calibration_*,
# confidence_*), the tuned fusion parameters (hybrid_params_*,
# query_context_v1.json), and the frozen 28 June 2026 corpus snapshot
# of the benchmark stock (A2 Sphera EN/DE dataset lists, indicator
# tables, embeddings) - the corpus every thesis result is scored on.
**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/ds_cache_v2_*.json
!**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/ds_cache_v2_a2_sphera_en.json
!**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/ds_cache_v2_a2_sphera_de.json
**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/indicators_*.json
!**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/indicators_a2_sphera_en.json
!**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/indicators_a2_sphera_de.json
**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/embeddings_*.bin
!**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/embeddings_a2_sphera_en.bin
!**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/embeddings_a2_sphera_de.bin
**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/lancedb/
**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/query_context_values_*.json
**/LCiA_Extension_Cache/_benchmark_settings.json

# ── Local run state (recreated at runtime) ────────────────────────
**/Validation.pushbutton/_settings.json
**/ExtractContext.pushbutton/data/materials_context.json

# ── Regenerable benchmark / analysis outputs ──────────────────────
**/phase0_benchmark.json
**/phase0_benchmark.md
**/phase1_benchmark*.json
**/phase1_benchmark*.md
**/tools/per_query_scores.csv
**/tools/ablation_query_context_*
**/tools/ladder_modes_results.json
**/tools/ladder_modes_fuzzy_results.json
**/tools/ladder_modes.md
**/tools/tune_fusion_results*.md
**/tools/sweep_reranker_top_k_results.md
**/tools/score_distribution_report.md
**/tools/tune_bm25_results.md
**/tools/gt_build/cache_index.tsv
**/tools/gt_build/candidates/
**/tools/gt_build/results/
**/tools/gt_build/proposals/

# ── Validation report exports ─────────────────────────────────────
# Future exports are ignored; only the two frozen 5 July 2026 runs
# behind the thesis result tables are committed.
**/validation_report_*.html
**/validation_report_*.png
